    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rooms",
     "texto": [
      "**Dom** usually means «house» or «home»; **mieszkanie** means «flat» or «apartment».",
      "**Pokój** means «room» and can also mean «peace»: context shows which one."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Fixed place: locative (miejscownik)",
     "texto": [
      "To say where something is, **w** and **na** usually go with the locative case (**miejscownik**): **dom → w domu**, **kuchnia → w kuchni**, **stół → na stole**.",
      "The noun changes form; in English the noun normally doesn't change after «in»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
